<BaseLayout title="About — Outside?" description="What Outside? does and what it does not check.">
  <h1>About Outside?</h1>
  <p>
    Outside? helps you decide whether to head outside now and spot a better time in the next 24 hours for walking,
    running, cycling or spending time outdoors.
  </p>
  <p>
    Matches are based on your preferences and the displayed forecast only. They are not safety assessments and do not
    include air quality, UV or official weather alerts.
  </p>
  <p>
    Weather data by <a href="https://open-meteo.com/">Open-Meteo</a>, licensed under
    <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
